{"scope":"knowledge","page":4,"pageSize":24,"total":200,"totalPages":9,"items":[{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-45ecf3ae3006","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"机制循环与耗尽","description":"1. 使用方式与规则分级 2. 循环是引擎与分集之间的那一层 3. 写清一次运行 4. 一次运行与一次重复的区别 5. 循环耗尽：症状与根因 6. 换代：先处置，再把紧迫性交过去 7. 一种常见变体：落差型循环 8. 循环与单集契约的关系 9. 合成示例 10. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/mechanism-loop.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-46ec59f7c32c","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"反派设计体系","description":"微短剧的反派不是\"坏人\"那么简单。反派的质量直接决定了爽点的质量——主角打脸一个路人甲，观众无感；打脸一个嚣张了十集的恶人，观众拍手叫好。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/villain-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-485684c0c8e5","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Location / View 设计","description":"陈设阶段、时段、天气、光态。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/location-and-view.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4becb52f096a","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"摄影机、环境声音与只读连续性","description":"transition 将两段分开。 production profile 继承的 `taste_option`。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts/references/camera-audio-continuity.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-video-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-4d78876afaec","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"爽点矩阵","description":"观众看微短剧的核心诉求就是\"爽\"。爽点设计得好，观众欲罢不能；设计得差，观众昏昏欲睡。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/satisfaction-matrix.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5035d0f0b9d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"人物设定图与 Look Variant","description":"人物设定图必须始终可识别为同一个 accepted identity，同时只呈现一套自洽 Look。不要把互不兼容的服装、发型、伤势、年龄或风化状态平均成一个合成人。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts/references/character-and-look.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-image-prompts","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-51620f9009d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"场次级声音戏剧设计","description":"剧本阶段只写**故事需要听见、撤掉或留白的声音事实**，不替逐镜提示词做混音。声音要改变观众 注意、空间感或人物压力，而不是每场复制一份环境音清单。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/scene-sound-dramaturgy.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-56ce041c26a3","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"观众此刻可以知道什么","description":"背影、门缝、画外声、浅景深和遮挡会决定观众何时知道一个人是谁、看见证据或发现门后有人。 需要同时防两种错：该给的信息被漂亮构图挡住；不该给的信息被镜头提前泄露。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama/references/audience-reveal.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5888aaaa5e0b","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"资产拆解审查清单","description":"资产设定完成前，每个下游引用都要解析到明确的身份条目，且变体必须在引用的剧情范围内有效。 未解决的出现项继续保持未决；不得为了让提示词或分镜继续工作，猜一个看似合理的 ID。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/asset-review-checklist.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-58a343f796e0","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"声音方向","description":"`voice_direction` 是 Character 记录的一部分（`AST-07`），跨集稳定。本场怎么说属于表演， 由 `$short-drama-write` 的配音本逐句决定。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-assets/references/voice-direction.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-assets","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-58e8fb5b8c78","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"题材指南","description":"短剧的差异化竞争力来自题材叠加。规则：","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/genre-guide.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5948c1a26d7d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"剧集类型 → 音乐风格映射","description":"根据影视剧类型推荐适配的音乐风格、乐器和人声方向。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/genre-music-mapping.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5a2803b603d6","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"Frozen Keyframe Craft","description":"Character/Look, Location/View, and Prop/State variants visible there. camera movement, and transforming weather belong to motion, not the keyframe.","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/keyframe-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-5c7486631c20","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"内容合规自检清单","description":"微短剧审核趋严，一旦触碰红线，整部剧可能下架甚至连累平台账号。合规不是创作的敌人，而是护栏——在护栏内把故事讲好，才是真本事。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-short-dr…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer/references/compliance-checklist.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-short-drama-series-writer","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-650b602f3f5d","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"合成正例：从剧本段到冻结关键帧","description":"本例只演示剧本内容怎样逐步变成镜头、关键帧和准确产物引用，不是镜头数量答案。 素材为全新合成。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard/references/screenplay-to-keyframe-example.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-storyboard","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-650f3beec51a","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","sub_categories":["storyboard"],"name":"内容合规自检清单","description":"微短剧审核趋严，一旦触碰红线，整部剧可能下架甚至连累平台账号。合规不是创作的敌人，而是护栏——在护栏内把故事讲好，才是真本事。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"oth